        ]
      },
      {
        "label": "来源派生",
        "detail": "Memobase事件正文更新不自动重建gist；Cognee memory_only保留资料用于重建，应明确产品删除范围。",
        "evidence": [
          "https://github.com/memodb-io/memobase/blob/358c16bbc6d687937d79bc2f984a11c3be8da901/src/server/api/memobase_server/controllers/event.py",
